SELECT 'gongkao', '部分合作反求', 'kp-eng-d-part-coop', CAST($${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "部分合作反求"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "borderColor": "#f59e0b", "icon": "💡"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "核心定义：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "已知工程最终花了多少天，也知道某阶段的合作时长，倒推某个人的单兵作战能力。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "一、题型定义与识别"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "这是一种复杂的逆向推理：“甲做了 3 天，然后乙加入一起做了 4 天完工。已知这份工作如果让甲单做要 15 天，问乙单干要几天？”"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "二、核心破题"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "不要被表面的阶段迷惑，直接统计甲和乙各自的总出勤天数。利用大方程倒退。"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "三、标准步骤"}]}, {"type": "text-diagram", "attrs": {"type": "mermaid", "content": "flowchart TD\nA[列出所有人头总天数: 甲共干了 7 天, 乙共干了 4 天] --> B[题目给了甲的单独完工时间(15天), 先以它为基石赋 W]\nB --> C[如果只给了一个时间, 就设 W = 15, 此时 P甲 = 1]\nC --> D[列出大方程: 7*P甲 + 4*P乙 = W]\nD --> E[代入数据: 7*1 + 4*P乙 = 15]\nE --> F[解出 P乙 = 2]\nF --> G[算出乙单干时间: T = W / P乙 = 15 / 2 = 7.5 天]"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "四、例题完整推导"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "【例题】", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 录入数据，小李先录了 2 小时，小王加入合作了 3 小时录完。已知这批数据小李单人需要 8 小时。问小王单人录完需要几小时？"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "清点人头：小李总共录了 2 + 3 = 5 小时。小王录了 3 小时。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "赋基石 W：已知小李单人要 8 小时。直接设 W = 8，那么 P李 = 1。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "列方程：5 × P李 + 3 × P王 = W。即 5×1 + 3×P王 = 8。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "解方程：3×P王 = 3，得出 P王 = 1。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "求目标：小王单人需要 T = W ÷ P王 = 8 ÷ 1 = 8 小时。"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "五、易错点纠偏"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "borderColor": "#ef4444", "icon": "⚠️"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "分段扣减容易迷失：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "有人喜欢算：小李单干2小时完成了 2/8 = 1/4，剩下 3/4 两人合干……这在算式上引入了繁分数，考场上一慌必错。记住，统一转化为整数的 W 结合人盯人方程，是避免分数的唯一出路。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "六、刷题建议"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "遇到只有一个单干时间的题，直接令 W = 这个时间。让那个人的效率变成最美丽的 1。"}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '部分合作反求的核心考点与实战推导。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "工程问题", "部分合作反求"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_eng_d_part_coop", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
FROM category_node ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, content_json = EXCLUDED.content_json, summary = EXCLUDED.summary, category_id = EXCLUDED.category_id, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, updated_time = NOW();
